    "cursorSync": "Off",
    "description": "One drone flight over Government Point and Percos Beach, in The Nature Conservancy's Dangermond Preserve, California, drawn two ways from the same photographs: an integrated mesh (an I3S scene layer of textured triangles) and Gaussian splats (3D Tiles of soft coloured ellipsoids), streamed from ArcGIS behind a swipe curtain on Kepler Plus, over the whole site and close up on the cliff and the shrubs, with the flight's five products and what sets a mesh apart from splats.",
